LeRobot SO-101 Installer for Ubuntu

This repository contains installation scripts only. It does not include or
redistribute the source code of LeRobot or any other third-party project.
LeRobot is downloaded from https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot at install
time and remains under its own license (Apache License 2.0).

The installation steps automated by these scripts, and the example commands in
README.md, are based on and adapted from the official LeRobot documentation,
Copyright Hugging Face, Inc.:

  - https://huggingface.co/docs/lerobot/main/en/installation
  - https://huggingface.co/docs/lerobot/en/so101
  - https://huggingface.co/docs/lerobot/en/il_robots

Third-party software installed by the scripts (each under its own license):

  - LeRobot (Hugging Face)          https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot
  - PyTorch                         https://pytorch.org
  - uv (Astral)                     https://github.com/astral-sh/uv
  - Feetech servo SDK               https://pypi.org/project/feetech-servo-sdk/
  - Ubuntu packages installed via apt (ffmpeg, build tools, etc.)

SO-ARM100 / SO-101 hardware design by The Robot Studio:
  https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100

